(R/'README.md').write_text('''# Engineering review revision 6 — stable source handoff

All nine surviving requirements are source implemented and focused verified. Four selected lanes contain **575 distinct passing cases**, with no failures, skips, errors or not-run: Server165, custody235, Client109 and Conversations66. Every selected lane has a clean normal Debug/local-reference build with zero warnings/errors. [Exact commands](commands.json) retain actually executed argv/cwd/tool timestamps and returned completion exits/chunks, with verbatim log/XML hashes; [selected results](final-focused-results.json) link each build/test to its exact successful command. Overlapping historical runs are excluded.

[Finding resolutions](finding-status.json) cover authentic issued blocked replacement recovery, full actor/state-I/O budgets, standalone pump budgets, strict private identifier carriers, atomic payload borrowing/retirement, replay profiles, owner factories, optional causation and discarded closed-history buffers. Replacement cases execute actual serialized guard/subscriber/protection/coordinator owners before/after dispatch and after an original blocked activation, including lost reply, exact historical phase recovery and healthy ordinal3 once. Actor late save/journal schedules retain independently admitted Unknown/pin originals and immutable terminal outcomes without another physical effect. Late pump providers cannot begin another phase. [Historical attempts](historical-attempts.json) distinguish genuine failed-before cases from response compatibility, fixture synchronization, compile/graph, invalid-filter and stale zero-case attempts. No synthetic mutation result is claimed.

[Ordered captures](ordered-baselines.json) retain142 entries, preserving the exact125-entry revision5 prefix. Seventeen fresh units capture51 changed source/test/packet paths and seven explicitly absent new-file bases, with no invented supplied before copy. [Current owned source](current-owned-source.json), [preservation](preservation.json) and [reviewed-source comparison](final-reviewed-source-comparison.json) verify exact source copies, immutable prior packages and protected/frozen intent. New types follow one object per named file; pre-existing nested types remain untouched. No new public test class or owner runner change was added; [correct-project class execution](required-class-audit.json) is recorded. Root retains the complete prior44-class mapping and independently audits the final Local matrix.

The four owner packets append truthful current source and runtime status, with exact prior bytes in owner-packets/before/agents. Root full Local matrix and the next fresh independent three-layer review remain pending. Focused source tests do not qualify deployed authorities, providers/backends/replicas/nonrollback anchors/isolation/all-copy destruction/restore/enrollment/Live acceptance. Original Story5.4 remains draft/backlog, parent in-progress, four dependencies Uncommitted, complete TargetVersionOrCommit and accepted compatibility command TBD. Branch B,365-day effective-at/exclusive-expiry policy,L/S/O/H/R,catalogue,dedicated service Party and human approval remain unchanged. No Git/submodule mutation, deployment, live invocation or external message occurred. Rejected B6/B10/E2, moot B11 and prior rejected policy/protocol expansions remain unchanged.

A finite budget releases an abandoned caller and never qualifies forced provider termination or backend isolation. Actor unfinished state-I/O exclusion grants no persistence authority; independently authenticated original journal/state remains necessary. Root owns cumulative source freeze, review and mandatory full verification. [Engineering handoff](engineering-handoff.json) and handoff-verification.json record the final package checks. No source or packet edit follows stable delivery.
''')
